00:15:30.244 --> 00:15:33.255
So the last step is using the ratio.

00:15:34.105 --> 00:15:39.695
So what we need to do is take the
ratio and times that by the empirical

00:15:39.705 --> 00:15:48.530
formula, which from before was C4H5N2O,
and by doing that, it's gonna give

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:59.570
you what the actual molecular formula
is, which is C8H10N4O2, which is

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:02.720
what keeps us going every single day.

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:07.740
This is the formula of caffeine,
the molecular formula, so that's

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:11.840
the true identity of it versus
the empirical formula, which

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:14.150
is the most simplified version.

